[node name="BodyLabel" type="Label" parent="BodyScroll"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(660, 0)
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.92, 0.96, 0.92, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 16
text = "Swap two adjacent tiles to match 3+ of
the same animal. Score more than your
opponent before the clock hits zero —
their score stays hidden until the
final 15 seconds (watch the bar at
the top — it tips toward whoever's
ahead)!

BIG PLAYS
• 4-in-a-row = Double (2x points)
• Two 3s at once = Triple (3x points)
• 5-in-a-row = Home Run (4x points)

ALL-STAR TILES
Big plays create special tiles. Swap
one into any neighbor to fire it:
  Arrow tile — clears that whole
  row or column
  Bomb tile — clears a surrounding
  3x3 area
  Rainbow tile — clears every tile
  of one color

RALLY & WALK-OFF WIN
Fill the Big Play Gauge for a 10-second,
2x-points Rally. In the final 15 seconds,
a Home Run, Rally, or MVP Blast that
puts you in the lead wins the game
instantly — a Walk-off Win!

FINAL CHANCE
Still behind when the clock hits zero?
You get 3 more swaps — hits or misses
both count — before the game ends.
Cross the target on any of them and
you win right there, same as a
Walk-off.

DURING THE GAME
A few special tiles can show up as
the clock runs:
  Golden Ball — worth 3x a normal
  tile's points when matched, and
  hops to a new spot instead of
  clearing
  Error Tile (a red X) — matching
  it costs you: the opponent's
  score jumps
  Extra Innings — appears for a
  5-second window; match it in
  time and, if you're still behind
  when the clock runs out, you get
  10 real bonus seconds to catch up

WIN STREAK POWER-UPS
Win 3 games in a row to bank a random
power-up: 3 Rows, 3 Columns, or a Big
Bomb. Tap its icon, then tap the board
to place it — it scores like a normal
match, and anything the refill sets up
afterward scores on top of that.

DIFFICULTY
Choose Rookie, Pro, All-Star, or Hall
of Fame when starting a season. Higher
difficulties raise target scores and
throw more Error Tiles into each game.
It's locked in for the whole season.

THE SEASON
Play all 7 other teams twice (14 games).
Finish in the top 4 to reach the
playoffs: a Semifinal, then a Finals
against your rival."

